rrect. Only the headline is generic."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","cli","error-guidance","refusals"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-01T11:19:53.418Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-01T11:19:53.418Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":45},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"When a refusal carries a specific code (for example likely_duplicate), the human output headline names that condition (for example 'Likely duplicate item') instead of the generic exit-class title; Regression test covers the likely_duplicate create refusal headline in human output; JSON code and title fields agree"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-f05lsg"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"The first line of a typed refusal identifies the refusal condition."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"pm create ... (duplicate) prints 'Error: Invalid argument value' as its first line while --json reports code likely_duplicate."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-8s53lj","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-11-01T11:19:53.418Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/escape_class","value":"production_defect"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"6f92eee3464f752f87a136cd8b2afe709723ff48f7b171aa87c7d41e70222c95","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","res